# UX audit screenshots — regenerated on demand from a live deploy or the local
# harness (see docs/game-design/UX-AUDIT-2026-07-29.md for the written audit,
# which is the part worth keeping). The PNGs are large, numerous and stale the
# moment the UI changes.
#
# The 8 files under ux-audit-2026-07-29/ predate this rule and stay tracked —
# ignoring a path does not untrack it, and deleting them would not shrink the
# repo since they are already in history. They are also the audit Phase 9's
# scope came from, so they are worth keeping.
docs/game-design/ux-audit-*/
